# Healthcare & E-commerce Analysis

## Overview
Analyzed order-to-cash workflows and billing reconciliation processes across healthcare and e-commerce domains. Focused on improving cash collections, reducing claim errors, and enhancing reporting accuracy.

## Key Contributions
- Partnered with stakeholders to gather requirements and document acceptance criteria.
- Executed gap analysis and root-cause investigations to resolve billing exceptions.
- Streamlined order-to-cash workflows through process mapping and validation strategies.
- Designed dashboards and prototypes to provide clarity on KPIs and reporting solutions.
- Audited financial information flows and payment reconciliation processes.

## Outcome
- Improved cash collections by 15% in e-commerce operations.
- Reduced claim errors and collection delays in healthcare RCM workflows.
- Enhanced reporting accuracy and stakeholder confidence in financial reconciliation.
